---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import IllustrationSlot from "../components/IllustrationSlot.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Ahmed Abdelaziz Hanafy, known as Sanfor, and his full stack software engineering background.">
  <section class="bg-base-200 py-16">
    <div class="container-page grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] lg:items-start">
      <div>
        <div class="breadcrumbs text-sm">
          <ul>
            <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
            <li>About</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <h1 class="mt-8 text-5xl font-bold">Ahmed Abdelaziz Hanafy</h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-xl text-base-content/75">Sanfor: full stack software engineer, systems builder, UI/UX thinker, and illustrator.</p>
      </div>
      <img class="w-full rounded-box border border-base-300 bg-base-100 shadow-sm" src="/assets/brand/sanfor-banner.png" alt="Sanfor illustrated brand banner" width="1280" height="336" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-base-100 py-16">
    <div class="container-page grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.3fr]">
      <IllustrationSlot label="Alexandria/location sketch" note="Future Alexandria, Egypt line sketch or location-inspired drawing." />
      <div class="prose max-w-none">
        <p>
          Ahmed started coding at 13 and has worked across JavaScript, PHP, Python, Go, Java, and low-level systems programming. He also works with UI/UX in Figma and brings an illustrator's eye to interface design.
        </p>
        <p>
          His public portfolio direction is full stack software engineering with strong emphasis on backend/API systems, automation, product engineering, databases, and practical security.
        </p>
        <h2>Professional Experience</h2>
        <p>
          At Skylimit LLC, Ahmed worked as a Full Stack Software Engineer from December 2022 to February 2026, building lead-generation, messaging, payment, reporting, IVR, and school collaboration systems.
        </p>
        <p>
          As a Junior Software Engineer on Fiverr from March 2021 to December 2022, he delivered custom software, automation, and consulting projects for international clients.
        </p>
        <h2>Education</h2>
        <p>
          Ahmed is pursuing a Bachelor's Degree in Business Information Systems at Alexandria University, with public study interests around databases, system architecture, corporate solutions, and workflow automation.
        </p>
        <h2>Tools And Interests</h2>
        <p>
          Publicly listed areas include Laravel, Django, React, Node.js, Three.js, databases, Docker, Git, cloud platforms, REST APIs, WebSockets, OAuth, UI/UX, information security, drawing, SaaS development, and product development.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
